---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Learn about Surrey Artificial Intelligence Society — our mission, values, and what members can expect from our student-led AI community.">

  <section class="bg-ai-bg text-ai-fg border-b border-ai-border">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-16 pb-12 sm:pt-24 sm:pb-16 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-6">Why we built this society.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 px-6 bg-ai-surface text-ai-fg border-b border-ai-border">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed text-ai-fg-muted space-y-6">
      <p>
        AI literacy is no longer just for computer scientists. It is a fundamental requirement for law, medicine, arts, and business.
      </p>
      <p>
        Surrey Artificial Intelligence Society exists to make artificial intelligence accessible, understandable, and engaging for students — regardless of course or prior experience. We believe that understanding how AI works and what it means for your field matters more than ever.
      </p>
      <p>
        As a student-led society under the Surrey Students' Union, we provide a space to learn, debate, and build — with no gatekeeping and no jargon. We welcome arts, humanities, and business students just as much as computer science students.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Principles -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 px-6 bg-ai-bg text-ai-fg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4">Our Approach</h2>
        <p class="text-ai-fg-muted text-lg leading-relaxed">The values that shape how we run the society — practically, not just on paper.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-16">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-ai-fg">Beginner Friendly</h3>
          <p class="text-ai-fg-muted leading-relaxed max-w-3xl text-lg">Every event should be approachable. We don't gatekeep knowledge or use unnecessary jargon. If a concept is complex, we break it down. We actively recruit and welcome students from non-STEM backgrounds to ensure diverse perspectives.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-ai-fg">Project Driven</h3>
          <p class="text-ai-fg-muted leading-relaxed max-w-3xl text-lg">Theory matters, but building things teaches you faster. We emphasize practical application over purely academic lectures, hosting build nights and workshops designed to give you hands-on experience.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-ai-fg">Ethically Grounded</h3>
          <p class="text-ai-fg-muted leading-relaxed max-w-3xl text-lg">We care about how AI is built and deployed, not just what it can do. Safety, bias, and ethics are regular topics of our discussions. We think about the long-term impacts of the systems we build.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
